00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:50.480
the NES version?

00:23:50.940 --> 00:23:52.060
Oh, this would be great

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:53.300
because you need a reason

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:54.320
not to try it on. That's what we're talking about.

00:23:54.840 --> 00:23:55.740
Yeah, we do.

00:23:57.800 --> 00:23:58.760
So like I said

00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:00.460
