00:25:16.360 --> 00:25:17.680
and Miss Pac-Man

00:25:17.680 --> 00:25:20.500
and stuff like that. I just couldn't pull it off

00:25:20.500 --> 00:25:22.160
in this game and I wasn't sure

00:25:22.160 --> 00:25:24.020
if it was just that I didn't give it enough

00:25:24.020 --> 00:25:25.700
like if there wasn't enough room

00:25:25.700 --> 00:25:26.740
between the barriers

00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:28.100
