00:25:44.700 --> 00:25:46.980
because being able to plot out your moves

00:25:47.460 --> 00:25:48.740
is what matters most

00:25:48.740 --> 00:25:49.920
in a game like Pac-Man right?

00:25:50.640 --> 00:25:51.860
Yeah yeah and I feel like

00:25:51.860 --> 00:25:52.840
in most games like this

00:25:53.240 --> 00:25:54.180
this is going to sound

00:25:54.180 --> 00:25:55.060
