00:26:02.820 --> 00:26:04.700
to the next you know to the next

00:26:05.240 --> 00:26:06.180
you know to the right

00:26:06.180 --> 00:26:07.580
of the D-pad if you were on the up

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:09.740
