00:26:19.280 --> 00:26:20.940
Yeah I don't I can't say that

00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:22.080
I had the same experience

00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:23.400
I thought that

00:26:23.400 --> 00:26:24.740
I was alright

